  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "せなかの　ハリの　けは　ふだんは\nねている。　こうふんすると　さかだち\nおそってくる　てきを　つきさすのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등의 가시 털은 평소에\n누워 있다가 흥분하면 곤두서\n덮쳐오는 적을 찌른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的針毛平時是倒伏的。\n一旦興奮就會倒立起來，\n刺向前來襲擊的敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les épines de ce Pokémon sont normalement\nbaissées, mais quand il s’énerve, elles se\ndressent afin de pourfendre ses agresseurs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Normalerweise liegen seine Stacheln am Rücken\nan, aber wenn es sich aufregt, stellen sie sich\nauf und stechen angreifende Gegner.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se siente amenazado, eriza las púas de\nsu lomo para pinchar a quien ose atacarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Normalmente tiene le spine che ha sulla schiena\nabbassate, ma se viene infastidito le drizza\nper trafiggere chi lo attacca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The spiny fur on its back is normally at rest.\nWhen this Pokémon becomes agitated, its fur\nstands on end and stabs into its attackers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背中の　ハリの　毛は　普段は\n寝ている。　興奮すると　逆立ち\n襲ってくる　敵を　突き刺すのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的针毛平时是倒伏的。\n一旦兴奋就会倒立起来，\n刺向前来袭击的敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se siente amenazado, eriza las púas de\nsu lomo para pinchar a quien ose atacarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せなかの　ながい　けは　どうらいしん。\nらくらいを　ひきよせ　かみなりを\nあびると　でんきぶくろに　ためこむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등의 기다란 털은 피뢰침이다.\n낙뢰를 끌어들여 번개를\n맞으면 전기 주머니에 저장한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的長毛是引雷針。\n引來落雷，吸收雷電後，\n就會將之儲存在電力袋中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa longue épine dorsale lui sert de paratonnerre.\nIl attire les éclairs et emmagasine la foudre\ndans sa poche électrique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein langer Stachel fungiert als Blitzableiter.\nDamit zieht es Blitze auf sich, die es dann in\nseinen Elektrotaschen speichert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El apéndice de su cabeza actúa a modo de\npararrayos. Aprovecha la energía de los rayos\nque atrae para llenar su bolsa eléctrica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si serve delle grandi spine che ha sulla schiena\ncome parafulmini, attirando i fulmini su di sé\nper incamerare elettricità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The long hairs on its back act as lightning rods.\nThe bolts of lightning it attracts are stored as\nenergy in its electric sac.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背中の　長い　毛は　導雷針。\n落雷を　引き寄せ　雷を\n浴びると　電気袋に　溜め込む。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的长毛是引雷针。\n引来打下的雷，沐浴雷电后，\n就会将之储存在电力袋中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El apéndice de su cabeza actúa a modo de\npararrayos. Aprovecha la energía de los rayos\nque atrae para llenar su bolsa eléctrica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１４ほんの　せなかの　ハリの　けは\nびっくりしたり　こうふんすることが\nあると　かってに　さかだってしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등에 난 14개의 바늘 털은\n놀라거나 흥분했을 때\n멋대로 곤두선다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的１４根針狀毛\n在牠受驚嚇或是興奮的時候\n會不受控制地豎起來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les quatorze épines de son dos se hérissent de\nleur propre chef quand il est surpris ou excité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat 14 lange stachelartige Strähnen auf dem\nRücken, die sich unfreiwillig aufstellen, wenn es\nsich freut oder von etwas überrascht wird.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eriza inconscientemente las 14 púas de su lomo\ncuando se asusta o se pone nervioso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando viene infastidito o colto di sorpresa,\nle 14 spine che ha sulla schiena si drizzano\nspontaneamente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it’s surprised or agitated, the 14 fur\nspikes on its back will stand up involuntarily.",
