      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１４本の　背中の　ハリの　毛は\nびっくりしたり　興奮することが\nあると　勝手に　逆立ってしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的１４根针毛在受惊\n或是兴奋的时候会随意竖起来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eriza inconscientemente las 14 púas de su lomo\ncuando se asusta o se pone nervioso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
